---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Phone from '../../components/Phone.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/config';
---
<Layout lang="en" title="Stille — conversations between you" description="A peer-to-peer messenger for Android. Choose a name, exchange an invite and start chatting — no phone number required." canonical="/en/">
  <Header />
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Stille for Android</p><h1 id="hero-heading">Conversations<br/>between <span class="word-you">you<svg viewBox="0 0 310 20" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 13Q145-3 304 9M50 17q110-8 213-3"/></svg></span></h1><p class="hero-description">Choose a name, exchange an invite and start chatting. Stille connects devices directly when a route between them is available.</p><div class="hero-cta"><a class="button" href={site.apk}>Download for Android <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/en/guide/">Get started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="download-meta">Android 8.0+ · APK · v{site.version}<br/><a href="/en/download/">Installation and updates</a></p></div>
      <figure class="hero-preview"><div class="hero-art"><span class="orbit orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="orbit orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="art-label"><span aria-hidden="true">↙</span>Less noise.<br/>More of what matters.</span><div class="hero-phone"><Phone/></div><div class="owl-hello"><span class="owl-caption">Just staying<br/>in touch.</span><img src="/assets/owl.svg" width="172" height="186" alt="Stille’s white owl mascot"/></div><span class="art-spark spark-one" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span class="art-spark spark-two" aria-hidden="true">+</span></div><figcaption>An interface illustration.<br/>Names and messages are fictional.</figcaption></figure>
    </section>
    <section class="start-section wrap" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="start-heading">From a name to a conversation</h2><p>No phone number needed.<br/>Connect through an invite.</p></div><div class="start-layout"><ol class="journey"><li><span class="step-number">1</span><div><h3>Choose a name</h3><p>Pick the name your contact will see. You can change your language and theme in settings.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-number">2</span><div><h3>Exchange an invite</h3><p>Create an invite in the app and share its link, or show the QR code nearby.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-number">3</span><div><h3>Start chatting</h3><p>Once the connection is confirmed, the person appears in your contacts.</p></div></li></ol><aside class="invite-aside"><img src="/assets/owl-invite.svg" width="180" height="168" loading="lazy" alt="Stille’s owl holding an invitation"/><p>Got an invite from a friend?</p><a href="/en/guide/">How to accept an invite →</a></aside></div></section>
    <section class="network-section wrap" aria-labelledby="network-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">About connections</p><h2 id="network-heading">Peer to peer,<br/>device to device</h2></div><div class="network-copy"><p>Stille needs an available route between devices. Invites without an address need the same local network. On other networks, a reachable address or relay may be needed.</p><p>The website does not connect devices or verify invites.</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="/en/guide/">Connection troubleshooting →</a><a href="/en/about/">About the project and encryption →</a></div></div></section>
  </main><Footer />
</Layout>
